      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe DiffusionGemma cookbook command `sglang serve --model-path google/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it --dllm-algorithm Gemma4Renoise --trust-remote-code --host 0.0.0.0 --port 30000` exits at startup with `error: unrecognized arguments: --dllm-algorithm Gemma4Renoise`. The checkpoint ships a diffusers `model_index.json` next to its SRT `config.json`, so auto-detection sends it to the diffusion backend, which has no dLLM options.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Make the diffusion detector decline requests that pass `--dllm-algorithm`, a flag only the language model runtime accepts, so auto-detection falls back to it.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- On unchanged main, the cookbook command exits with the error above. With the checkpoint path, host, and port changed to local values and `--max-running-requests 8` added, the cookbook command now selects the language model runtime and answers chat and chat-templated generate requests on one H200. Together with the decode graph OOM fix, the same command without `--max-running-requests` also starts and answers them.\r\n- Routing is unchanged for launches without the flag, including a Cosmos3 diffusers checkpoint, and for explicit `--model-type` overrides. The `--dllm-algorithm=...` and positional model path forms also route to the language model runtime.\r\n- `test/registered/unit/cli` passes with the same 12 tests as main. Pre-commit passes.\r\n\r\n## Limits\r\n\r\n- Without the decode graph OOM fix, the cookbook command still needs `--max-running-requests` to start on one H200.\r\n- A DiffusionGemma launch without `--dllm-algorithm` still routes to the diffusion backend.\r\n- The new check reads only the command line, so a launch that passes the model path on the command line and sets `dllm-algorithm` only in an SRT `--config` file still routes to the diffusion backend as on main and needs `--dllm-algorithm` on the command line or `--model-type llm`.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38668380988](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668380988)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38668381025](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668381025)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38668380986](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38668380986)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
